        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Action: Prototypically, action is expressed by a verb: move, hate, think, discover. But actions also appear in nominalizations: movement, hatred, thought, discovery. Actions are also implied in some adjectives: advisable, resultant, explanatory, etc.",
